data: {"id": "9e1b5e2ff2074179-thinking-parallel_evidence-1821", "run_id": "9e1b5e2ff2074179", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的工具结果，对 `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` 的 NotReady 原因进行证据分析：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n*   **Pod:** `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l`\n*   **Namespace:** `aiops-case-09`\n*   **UID:** `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`\n*   **Phase:** `Running` (说明容器进程仍在运行，未崩溃重启)\n*   **Owner:** `ReplicaSet/workload-5f4fb9ff45`\n\n### 2. 支持 \"NotReady\" 的直接证据\n*   **Kubernetes 条件:** `Ready` 状态为 `False`。\n    *   **Reason:** `ContainersNotReady`\n    *   **Message:** `containers with unready status: [app]` (YAML输出)\n   ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788812458267, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

